<section class="gg-path-hero">
  <div class="gg-path-bg"></div>

  <div class="gg-container gg-path-hero-grid">
    <div class="gg-path-copy reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Goal Grower App</span>

      <h1>A garden for becoming.</h1>

      <p>
        Goal Grower turns the things you care about into living plants,
        so progress feels visible, personal, and easier to return to.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
        <a href="#garden-path" class="gg-btn-soft">Walk the Path</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-path-visual reveal">
      <div class="gg-path-note note-left">
        <strong>Return</strong>
        <span>without shame</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-path-note note-right">
        <strong>Grow</strong>
        <span>with small actions</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-path-phone main-path-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '1000x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower garden screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-path-phone side-path-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker small"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '700x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower goals list screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-path-belief">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-belief-window reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">The problem</span>
      <h2>Most goals disappear because they never feel alive.</h2>
      <p>
        Checklists are useful, but they are easy to abandon. Goal Grower gives
        your goals a place, a shape, and a reason to be cared for.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-garden-path" id="garden-path">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">The garden path</span>
      <h2>From empty space to visible growth.</h2>
      <p>
        The homepage follows the same emotional journey as the app.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-path-steps">
      <article class="gg-path-step reveal">
        <div class="gg-path-step-copy">
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Begin with space.</h3>
          <p>
            Before the garden grows, there is a quiet place to decide what matters.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-path-phone step-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-no-goals-yet.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'No goals yet screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gg-path-step reveal">
        <div class="gg-path-step-copy">
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Name what you are growing.</h3>
          <p>
            Your goals become easier to remember when they have a clear place to live.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-path-phone step-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal list screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gg-path-step reveal">
        <div class="gg-path-step-copy">
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Watch effort become visible.</h3>
          <p>
            The garden turns consistency into something you can see and care about.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-path-phone step-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Garden screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-detail-proof">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Structure underneath</span>
      <h2>Growth still needs clarity.</h2>
      <p>
        The garden gives your progress emotion. The details screen gives it structure,
        so goals feel meaningful and manageable at the same time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-path-phone proof-phone reveal">
      <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
      <div class="gg-phone-screen">
        {{ 'gg-exercise-more-goal-details-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal details screen' }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-path-video" id="runthrough">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading center reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">Runthrough</span>
      <h2>See the app move.</h2>
      <p>
        A small runthrough of the real app experience.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-path-phone video-phone reveal">
      <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
      <div class="gg-phone-screen">
        <video
          src="{{ 'Screen_Recording_goal-grower-runthrough.mp4' | asset_url }}"
          autoplay
          muted
          loop
          playsinline
          preload="metadata"
        ></video>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-shared-path">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-shared-window reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="gg-kicker">Shared gardens</span>
        <h2>Growth can be personal and shared.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          Create shared gardens with friends, spouses, classmates, roommates, or
          accountability partners. Everyone grows their own goals while contributing
          to something together.
        </p>

        <div class="gg-pills">
          <span>Friends</span>
          <span>Family</span>
          <span>Classmates</span>
          <span>Partners</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-human-loop">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">The loop</span>
      <h2>Not productivity. Relationship.</h2>
      <p>
        The goal is not to become perfect. The goal is to keep coming back.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-loop-grid">
      <div class="gg-loop-card reveal">
        <span>Notice</span>
        <p>Choose what deserves your attention.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-loop-card reveal">
        <span>Plant</span>
        <p>Give that intention a place.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-loop-card reveal">
        <span>Water</span>
        <p>Use small actions to keep it alive.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-loop-card reveal">
        <span>Return</span>
        <p>Come back and grow again.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-maker-path">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">Built by a student</span>
      <h2>Made by someone who needed it too.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is being built to make progress feel less cold and more alive:
        part app, part garden, part reminder that growth takes time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-maker-card reveal">
      <h3>Current progress</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Goal tracking built</li>
        <li>Personal gardens built</li>
        <li>Shared gardens in beta</li>
        <li>Android testing next</li>
        <li>Widgets and reminders future</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-path">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Support the build</span>
      <h2>Help the garden keep growing.</h2>
      <p>
        Support Goal Grower development, future apps, digital tools, and products
        made for intentional growth.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-support-grid">
      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-support-card reveal">
        <span>Main</span>
        <h3>Goal Grower Support</h3>
        <p>Help fund development, design, testing, and future features.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-support-card reveal">
        <span>Tools</span>
        <h3>Digital Products</h3>
        <p>Templates, planners, and intentional growth resources.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-support-card reveal">
        <span>Objects</span>
        <h3>Physical Products</h3>
        <p>Merch, desk items, and calming productivity products.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-path-final">
  <div class="gg-container reveal">
    <span class="gg-kicker">The mission</span>
    <h2>Build a life you can keep returning to.</h2>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is about making progress feel human, hopeful, and worth caring about.
    </p>
    <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
  </div>
</section>

